AdrenoMetal — the upstream project this port is based on

  AdrenoMetal
  Metal API frontend and metal2vulkan translation
  https://github.com/UniXNU/AdrenoMetal

  MIT License
  Copyright (c) 2026 NativeMetal contributors

  AdrenoMetal is the origin of the architecture and of the reusable frontend:
  the Metal API frontend (NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm), the Metal-object C ABI
  (bridge/NativeMetalObjects.h and .rs), the metal2vulkan integration
  (bridge/NativeMetalBridge.*), the offline command wire model, the plugin
  discovery/publish design, the host-test style, and the Metal self-test
  structure. This repository's contribution is the Mali-specific port: the
  PanVK backend seam, the NativeMali ABI client, the MT6768 plugin and scanout
  path, and the tests for those pieces.

  A local reference copy is kept in AdrenoMetal-reference/ for development.
  It is gitignored and is never committed, built into the product, or
  presented as part of this repository.

  The MIT terms that apply to AdrenoMetal-derived material are reproduced at
  the end of this file.

