   committed in this repository. The patches keep Mesa's MIT headers.

3. NativeMali
   SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
   The kernel driver and the fixed wire ABI (NativeMaliABI.h) live in the
   separate Mali-G52 repository. This repository consumes the ABI; it does not
   relicense or duplicate the driver.

4. Device facts
   The GPU identity, register window, device tree and measured clock/voltage
   facts are recorded in Mali-G52/docs/DEVICE.md with their raw sources. They
   are not restated here as new measurements.

